 "result": "Call order (the repo is `tessel`):\n\n1. `Tessel.finalize_request` (`src/tessel/app.py:1021`). The dispatch method at ~`app.py:1019` calls it, and the error path at `app.py:948` calls it with `from_error_handler=True`. It builds the response with `make_response`.\n2. `Tessel.finalize_reply` (`src/tessel/app.py:1394`). It runs the after-request functions, then calls `persist_session` at line 1416 unless the session is a null session.\n3. `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session` (`src/tessel/sessions.py:337`). It does three things:\n   - It adds `Vary: Cookie` if the session was accessed.\n   - If the session is empty and was modified, it calls `response.delete_cookie` and returns.\n   - Otherwise it calls `cookie_needs_write` (`sessions.py:233`) and returns early if that is false.\n4. `get_expiration_time` and `make_signer(app).dumps(dict(session))` produce the expiry and the signed value.\n5. `response.set_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:374`) writes the cookie.\n\n`src/tessel/testing.py:177` also calls `persist_session`, but that is for the test helper, not normal requests.",
